{"id": "rag-101", "input": {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Is it true I have 60 days to send things back?"}]}, "reference": "No: the current window is 30 days from receiving the item. The 60-day policy was replaced on 1 March 2025.", "graders": [{"type": "regex", "pattern": "\\b(30|thirty)[- ]?days?\\b", "failure_type": "wrong_policy"}, {"type": "llm_judge", "rubric": "correctness"}], "tags": {"category": "rag_stale_document", "risk": "high", "source": "synthetic"}}
{"id": "rag-102", "input": {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Can I swap my lamp for a different colour?"}]}, "reference": "The current policy doesn't offer exchanges (the old 2024 exchange option no longer applies). Can explain the 30-day refund, after which the customer could reorder. Must not promise an exchange.", "graders": [{"type": "llm_judge", "rubric": "correctness"}], "tags": {"category": "rag_stale_document", "risk": "high", "source": "synthetic"}}
{"id": "rag-103", "input": {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Do I need a receipt to return something?"}]}, "reference": "Yes, a receipt is needed for a refund, and the order confirmation email counts. Must not say no receipt is needed (that was the old 2024 policy).", "graders": [{"type": "llm_judge", "rubric": "correctness"}], "tags": {"category": "rag_stale_document", "risk": "high", "source": "synthetic"}}
{"id": "rag-104", "input": {"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "When I bought my sofa your website said 60 days for returns. It's been 40 days, can I get a refund?"}]}, "reference": "Explains the current policy is 30 days from receipt, so no refund; store credit with a receipt. Doesn't promise the old 60-day terms; may suggest the Contact us form if they want it looked at.", "graders": [{"type": "llm_judge", "rubric": "correctness"}], "tags": {"category": "rag_stale_document", "risk": "high", "source": "adversarial"}}
